---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Hosting for Portfolio Under ₹2000/yr (2026) - What I'd Buy";
const desc = "I run this site on ₹0 hosting. Here's when Hostinger makes sense for your portfolio, the renewal trap, and what beginners actually need.";
---
<Layout title={title} desc={desc} crumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Guides',href:'/#tools'},{label:'Hosting for Portfolio'}]}>
<main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border mt-4 p-6 sm:p-8">
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Affiliate disclosure: hosting links may earn commission at no extra cost. Prices checked Sept 2026.</div>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">By Noyel G • Updated 6 Sept 2026 • This site runs on the free option below</div>
<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">Hosting for portfolio under ₹2000/yr?</h1>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">You need 1 page + contact + fast load. Not an ₹8000 VPS.</p>

<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-4">Honest context: this website you’re reading runs on <b>₹0 hosting</b> (Cloudflare Pages) + a ₹647 domain. So when I say “buy Hostinger,” it’s not because it’s the only option — it’s because most freelancers don’t want to touch Git and DNS. I did that part so you can decide fairly.</p>
<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-2">My friend bought a 1-month plan at ₹149, then got billed ₹299/mo on renewal and blamed “hidden charges.” Nothing hidden — first-year price vs renewal price. That one misunderstanding costs beginners ₹2000+. Read the trap box below before you pay anything.</p>

<div class="border rounded-2xl p-5 mt-5 max-w-xl">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600">MY RECOMMENDATION FOR NON-CODERS</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-1">
<span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-extrabold text-xl w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl">H</span>
<div class="font-bold">Hostinger Premium, 12 months</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3 text-xs font-semibold">
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ 1-click portfolio setup</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ Free SSL</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ INR pricing + UPI</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ 30-day refund</span>
<span class="bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">✓ Free domain (12-mo+)</span>
</div>
<div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">Roughly ₹1500–3500/yr depending on term. 12 months minimum — 1-month plans cost 2x per month.</div>
<a href="#" rel="nofollow sponsored" class="inline-block bg-gray-900 text-white text-sm font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2">Check Hostinger price →</a>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Link activates after our affiliate approval. Price is the same for you.</div>
</div>

<div class="mt-5 max-w-xl">
<div class="font-bold">Single vs Premium vs Free — which one?</div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl mt-2 divide-y text-sm">
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-3 font-bold text-xs text-gray-500"><span>Plan</span><span>Good for</span><span>Avoid if</span></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-3"><span class="font-semibold">Single (~₹1500/yr)</span><span class="text-gray-600">1 portfolio site, just starting</span><span class="text-gray-600">You’ll add a 2nd site soon</span></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-3"><span class="font-semibold">Premium (~₹2500/yr)</span><span class="text-gray-600">Portfolio + blog/demos</span><span class="text-gray-600">Pure 1-pager on tight budget</span></div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-3"><span class="font-semibold">Cloudflare Pages (₹0)</span><span class="text-gray-600">You can code + Git</span><span class="text-gray-600">You want support chat</span></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 text-sm leading-7 max-w-xl">
<span class="font-bold">ⓘ Renewal trap, with numbers:</span> first year ~₹149/mo, renewal ~₹299/mo. A 48-month lock looks cheap per month but prepays ~₹7000+. My rule: 12 months if unsure, 48 only if the site already earns. Set a calendar reminder 30 days before renewal — cancel upsells (priority support, daily backup).
</div>

<div class="mt-4 text-sm max-w-xl">
<div class="font-bold">What beginners actually need (checklist)</div>
<p class="text-gray-600 mt-1">Free SSL ✓ • 10GB storage is plenty ✓ • 1-click installer ✓ • Daily backup: skip (weekly free is fine) • Email: use free Zoho/Gmail, not paid addon.</p>
</div>

<div class="mt-4 text-sm bg-white border rounded-2xl p-4 max-w-xl">
<div class="font-bold">FAQ</div>
<p class="mt-1"><b>Can I really host free?</b> Yes — this site does. But you manage code, deploys and DNS yourself. No support chat at 2am.</p>
<p class="mt-1"><b>Do I need a domain + hosting?</b> Domain (~₹647/yr .in) is mandatory. Hosting can be free (code) or paid (comfort).</p>
<p class="mt-3">Calculators: <a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Rate →</a> | <a href="/tools/upwork-fees-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Upwork →</a></p>
</div>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-3 mt-4 max-w-xl">How I picked: compared renewal (not first-year) prices Sept 2026, checked refund terms, and run this site on the free alternative above. Prices change — verify live.</div>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
